  "details": "Description\n\nI have been trying over and over to fix this, i am on my ipad and i cant join any world without it taking me into the base homeworld that you start with when making a new account, i have even tried to join off friends or drop portals but nothing  has changedi changed my home world and it still takes me here. It works when i walk through the portals here but thats it. It worked fine when i first created my account but then its been weird since, i have cleared all cache as well\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJust make it where i could join others instead of redirecting me, i am on ipad so i know its a little buggy but i would like to play with my friends!\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.20202\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-30_18-51-43.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_49587ea2-8efa-4c03-84a5-c2df7f5d088a/1/file)",
